{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/93ace2b7b2c738ac456e8a09a2c75b90.avif?t=1765353886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u25a0 Your endless nightmare starts here.</u></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl who should have awoken finds herself adrift once again in a sea of raging nightmares...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The side story to NeverAwake makes a grand return, reimagined as an arcade-style roguelite shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teaming up with your new partner, Gabe-chan, face ever-shifting horrors in nightmarish stages. Equip new weapons, new accessories, and survive even more punishing battles. The curtain rises once again on a robust, arcade-style nightmare world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u25a0 The rules have changed! The world of NeverAwake has been reborn as a roguelite shooter!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on randomly generated levels, choosing weapons and accessories as you progress to create unique builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the nightmare world of NeverAwake as a roguelite shooter, now designed for both quick play sessions and high replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/f7531bce447773e88f07d45d00ef63a9.poster.avif?t=1765353886\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/f7531bce447773e88f07d45d00ef63a9.webm?t=1765353886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/f7531bce447773e88f07d45d00ef63a9.mp4?t=1765353886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rem's beloved plushie, Gabe-chan, joins the fight as her protective buddy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacks have been expanded for more strategic battles. Of course, all-new stages and terrifying new bosses have also been added!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly anticipated new weapons and accessories are here, too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the best use of the weapons found within the levels to take down the monsters haunting your sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/41bd9b6b3e2bec7888fbacd3c80d30a7.poster.avif?t=1765353886\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/41bd9b6b3e2bec7888fbacd3c80d30a7.webm?t=1765353886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/41bd9b6b3e2bec7888fbacd3c80d30a7.mp4?t=1765353886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u25a0 Story:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rem had safely awoken from her nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was feeling better, finally living in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one night... she found herself tormented by bad dreams yet again. Night after night, the darkness returns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could possibly be the cause?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And will Rem ever be free of these recurring nightmares?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/cb7d4b1ce6ab6b84227b4a8533cefdbe.poster.avif?t=1765353886\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/cb7d4b1ce6ab6b84227b4a8533cefdbe.webm?t=1765353886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/cb7d4b1ce6ab6b84227b4a8533cefdbe.mp4?t=1765353886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u25a0 NeverAwake FLASHBACK Features:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an eccentric, bizarre world set in the nightmares of a young girl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeously hand-drawn graphics and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unique progression through randomized stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay and high-stakes boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 90 stages and dozens of tricky bosses to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast array of weapons and accessories to create your preferred builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with tons of added features not present in the original NeverAwake.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/dd529f018e6576e98fbd3969739cdcc0.avif?t=1765353886\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras_big/dd529f018e6576e98fbd3969739cdcc0.avif?t=1765353886 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u25a0 About the original NeverAwake:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NeverAwake is a nightmare shooter bursting with unique world-building and original gameplay rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rem fights against the things she dislikes: vegetables, dogs, school friends, and more. What awaits her at the end of her battles...? Will she ever be able to wake up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NeverAwake has received critical acclaim, including the top prize Vermillion Gate Award at BitSummit X-Roads (2022) and the Famitsu Gold Award, alongside a high Metascore. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Another Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072510/83ecef7655fffaf99e6bc881a75cdf0248894ba3.jpg"},{"name":"Whispers of Fear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072510/e026e47c68be81401a6f5dd9b4396235762f4a68.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Dream Abyss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072510/ace5574a5947079ca97cce5b6772a3084b494327.jpg"},{"name":"Root Cause","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072510/8bd4d064e98895304b86aed29be6e17d5394d6e9.jpg"},{"name":"The Root of All Evil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072510/e2763b9fb28e43633039e6ac9cc9d4659c0347a5.jpg"},{"name":"Found the Key!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072510/9755e8d672f1817adc0755b9b436802e576c7d47.jpg"},{"name":"Found Another Key!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072510/a3421a2363311fba4706d6b69b8f9e13be6de23c.jpg"},{"name":"Bed Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072510/26eeef73013f38b56c5055c66f45adf13de3eb94.jpg"},{"name":"Sleep Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072510/a84582e082a79b2303b8898f3e23c0a7bfd1cc58.jpg"},{"name":"Dreamy Sprinter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072510/bce7d42651bec52c6430c6b1cbd90c75dc746850.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/a